{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/letter-to-the-chair-of-the-food-standards-agency","content_id":"331b6b92-e20e-4387-a91f-78e60eccd495","description":"The Parliamentary Under-Secretary of State writes to the chair of the Food Standards Agency to confirm agreed economic growth goals.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9325539","isbn":"","title":"Letter to Professor Susan Jebb, Chair of the Food Standards Agency (FSA): FSA economic growth goals","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/letter-to-the-chair-of-the-food-standards-agency/letter-to-professor-susan-jebb-chair-of-the-food-standards-agency-fsa-fsa-economic-growth-goals"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\">\n<p>The Rt Hon Sharon Hodgson MP, Parliamentary Under-Secretary of State for Public Health and Prevention, has written to Professor Susan Jebb, Chair of the Food Standards Agency (<abbr title=\"Food Standards Agency\">FSA</abbr>).</p>\n\n<p>In her letter, Minister Hodgson confirmed the economic growth goals agreed between the Department of Health and Social Care (<abbr title=\"Department of Health and Social Care\">DHSC</abbr>) and the <abbr title=\"Food Standards Agency\">FSA</abbr>.</p>\n\n<p>The <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/food-standards-agency-fsa-economic-growth-goals\"><abbr title=\"Food Standards Agency\">FSA</abbr> economic growth goals</a> were included as an annex to this letter.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-08T11:00:01Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","emphasised_organisations":["7cd6bf12-bbe9-4118-8523-f927b0442156","447f8075-1c8c-40d3-8119-3e45ea9e6496"],"featured_attachments":["9325539"],"first_public_at":"2026-07-08T12:00:01.000+01:00","national_applicability":{"england":{"applicable":true,"label":"England"},"northern_ireland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Northern Ireland"},"scotland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Scotland"},"wales":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Wales"}},"political":true,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"correspondence","first_published_at":"2026-07-08T12:00:01+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/letter-to-the-chair-of-the-food-standards-agency","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/letter-to-the-chair-of-the-food-standards-agency","base_path":"/government/publications/letter-to-the-chair-of-the-food-standards-agency","content_id":"331b6b92-e20e-4387-a91f-78e60eccd495","document_type":"correspondence","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-08T11:00:01Z","schema_name":"publication","title":"Letter to the chair of the Food Standards Agency","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/letter-to-the-chair-of-the-food-standards-agency","withdrawn":false}],"children":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/letter-to-the-chair-of-the-food-standards-agency/letter-to-professor-susan-jebb-chair-of-the-food-standards-agency-fsa-fsa-economic-growth-goals","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/letter-to-the-chair-of-the-food-standards-agency/letter-to-professor-susan-jebb-chair-of-the-food-standards-agency-fsa-fsa-economic-growth-goals","base_path":"/government/publications/letter-to-the-chair-of-the-food-standards-agency/letter-to-professor-susan-jebb-chair-of-the-food-standards-agency-fsa-fsa-economic-growth-goals","content_id":"7634eeda-3285-40d4-867c-9998d790e98c","document_type":"html_publication","links":{"parent":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/letter-to-the-chair-of-the-food-standards-agency","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/letter-to-the-chair-of-the-food-standards-agency","base_path":"/government/publication